# logrotate config for the PhantomSDR-Plus admin stack (proxy.log + admin.log)
#
# ── EDIT ME BEFORE INSTALLING ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is site-specific. Three things below refer to the machine it was
# written on and must be changed to match yours:
#
#   1. the two log paths  — replace /home/sv1btl/PhantomSDR-Plus with your own
#      and the `olddir`      install dir (the `sdr_base_dir` in admin_config.json)
#   2. `su sv1btl sv1btl` — replace with the user:group that owns those logs,
#                           i.e. whoever runs manage_admin.sh (usually $USER)
#
# Get the right values with:
#   echo "$PWD"            # run from your PhantomSDR-Plus dir → the log paths
#   id -un; id -gn         # → the two names for the `su` line
#
# Skipping step 1 makes logrotate silently do nothing (the paths don't exist,
# and `missingok` suppresses the warning). Skipping step 2 makes it refuse the
# logs entirely, because their parent directory is not owned by root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This file is NOT what logrotate reads. It is the repo master copy; logrotate
# reads /etc/logrotate.d/phantomsdr. The two are independent — after editing
# this file, re-run the install command below or your change has no effect.
#
# Install (system-wide, runs from the daily logrotate timer):
#   sudo cp logrotate/phantomsdr /etc/logrotate.d/phantomsdr
#   sudo chown root:root /etc/logrotate.d/phantomsdr
#   sudo chmod 644 /etc/logrotate.d/phantomsdr
#
# Dry-run check:
#   sudo logrotate -d /etc/logrotate.d/phantomsdr
#
# copytruncate is required: manage_admin.sh starts both processes with
# `>> <log>` and neither reopens its stdout, so a plain rename would leave
# them writing into the rotated file forever.
#
# olddir keeps the compressed archives out of the project root; createolddir
# makes logrotate create the directory itself if it is missing.

/home/sv1btl/PhantomSDR-Plus/proxy.log
/home/sv1btl/PhantomSDR-Plus/admin.log {
    su sv1btl sv1btl
    daily
    maxsize 10M
    rotate 7
    compress
    missingok
    notifempty
    copytruncate
    olddir /home/sv1btl/PhantomSDR-Plus/logproxy
    createolddir 0755 sv1btl sv1btl
}
